{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 25,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        54.572994232177734,
        526.7071533203125,
        67.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "to active TB disease and an increased incidence of active TB was available for the following 15 risk groups:",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.57299041748047,
        526.6832885742188,
        81.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "adult and child TB contacts, health care workers and students, people living with HIV, patients on dialysis,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        82.57299041748047,
        526.6700439453125,
        95.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "immigrants from countries with a high TB burden, patients initiating anti-TNF therapy, people who use illicit",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        96.57299041748047,
        526.71533203125,
        109.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "drugs, prisoners, homeless people, patients receiving an organ or haematological transplant, patients with",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        110.57299041748047,
        526.7144775390625,
        123.37299346923828
      ],
      "text": "silicosis, patients with diabetes, people with harmful use of alcohol, tobacco smokers and underweight people.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.57299041748047,
        526.6731567382812,
        137.37298583984375
      ],
      "text": "An increased risk for progression to active TB was reported for 4 of the 15 groups: people living with HIV, adult",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        138.572998046875,
        526.6040649414062,
        151.37298583984375
      ],
      "text": "and child TB contacts, patients on dialysis and underweight people. Increased risks for active TB were reported",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        152.572998046875,
        245.71412658691406,
        165.37298583984375
      ],
      "text": "for all groups except underweight people.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        180.59292602539062,
        237.7548828125,
        196.096923828125
      ],
      "text": "Rationale for the recommendations",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.4156494140625,
        526.6641845703125,
        212.21563720703125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted that people in HIV-negative clinical risk groups, such as patients initiating anti-TNF treatment,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        213.4156494140625,
        526.6653442382812,
        226.21563720703125
      ],
      "text": "patients on dialysis, patients preparing for organ or haematological transplant and patients with silicosis,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        227.4156494140625,
        526.6821899414062,
        240.21563720703125
      ],
      "text": "would benefit from testing for and treatment of LTBI regardless of the background TB epidemiology, because",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.4156494140625,
        526.6720581054688,
        254.21563720703125
      ],
      "text": "of their increased risks for progression to active TB disease. The GDG made strong recommendations despite",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.4156494140625,
        526.6710815429688,
        268.21563720703125
      ],
      "text": "the low- to very low-quality evidence on the basis of its judgement that the identified at-risk population groups",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.4156494140625,
        526.6651000976562,
        282.21563720703125
      ],
      "text": "were at increased risk for progression to active TB disease and that the benefits of treatment outweigh the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.4156494140625,
        136.45510864257812,
        296.21563720703125
      ],
      "text": "potential harm.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.08563232421875,
        526.7052001953125,
        315.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also concluded that the evidence for the benefits of systematic testing and treatment of LTBI might",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.08563232421875,
        526.6712036132812,
        329.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "not outweigh the harm in the following population risk groups: health care workers, immigrants from countries",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.08563232421875,
        526.7012329101562,
        343.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "with a high TB burden, prisoners, homeless people and people who use illicit drugs. The GDG judged, however,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.08563232421875,
        526.6693115234375,
        357.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "that the benefits might outweigh the harm to a greater extent in settings with a low TB incidence than in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        359.08563232421875,
        526.6301879882812,
        371.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "those with a high TB incidence because of the background TB epidemiology and the risks for transmission and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.08563232421875,
        526.6651611328125,
        385.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "reinfection. A decision to test for and treat LTBI systematically in these population groups should be made in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        387.08563232421875,
        526.68115234375,
        399.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "accordance with the local TB epidemiology and context, health system structure, availability of resources and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        401.08563232421875,
        526.6713256835938,
        413.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "overall health priorities. Priority must be given to individuals who were recently infected with TB, as documented",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.08563232421875,
        526.6824340820312,
        427.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "by conversion from negative to positive in LTBI tests (either IGRA or TST). The GDG also concluded that recent",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.08563232421875,
        526.6992797851562,
        441.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "immigrants from countries with a high TB burden to one with a low burden should be prioritized. The GDG",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        443.08563232421875,
        526.7062377929688,
        455.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "emphasized, however, that a person’s status – testing positive for LTBI or receiving LTBI treatment – should not",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        457.08563232421875,
        299.75909423828125,
        469.8856201171875
      ],
      "text": "affect the process, procedure or status of immigration.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        476.7556457519531,
        526.7221069335938,
        489.5556335449219
      ],
      "text": "The GDG noted the paucity of data from clinical trials on the benefits and harm of systematic LTBI testing and",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.7556457519531,
        526.6505126953125,
        503.5556335449219
      ],
      "text": "treatment of patients with diabetes, people with harmful use of alcohol, tobacco smokers and underweight",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.755615234375,
        526.7161865234375,
        517.5556030273438
      ],
      "text": "people. They concluded that the benefits of systematic, routine testing and treatment of these risk groups",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        518.755615234375,
        526.6162109375,
        531.5556030273438
      ],
      "text": "do not outweigh the risks, unless they are part of the groups covered in the recommendations, regardless of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.755615234375,
        194.83912658691406,
        545.5556030273438
      ],
      "text": "background TB epidemiology.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.4256591796875,
        526.6591796875,
        565.2256469726562
      ],
      "text": "The GDG agreed that prioritization of groups on the basis of their risk and the local and national context",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        566.4256591796875,
        526.71142578125,
        579.2256469726562
      ],
      "text": "(e.g. epidemiology, resource availability) would be acceptable to individuals and to key stakeholders, including",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        580.4256591796875,
        526.6643676757812,
        593.2256469726562
      ],
      "text": "clinicians and programme managers. It noted that the high risk for ongoing TB transmission of certain risk",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.4256591796875,
        524.4012451171875,
        607.2256469726562
      ],
      "text": "groups, such as health care workers (including students), prisoners (and prison staff), immigrants from high-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.4256591796875,
        526.7242431640625,
        621.2256469726562
      ],
      "text": "incidence countries, homeless people and people who use illicit drugs, requires attention, so that the benefit",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        622.4256591796875,
        269.505126953125,
        635.2256469726562
      ],
      "text": "of treatment is not compromised by reinfection.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        650.443359375,
        235.1857147216797,
        665.9473266601562
      ],
      "text": "Considerations for implementation",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.2659301757812,
        526.7122192382812,
        682.06591796875
      ],
      "text": "A decision of national TB programmes and other stakeholders on priority risk groups for programmatic",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        683.2659301757812,
        526.7191162109375,
        696.06591796875
      ],
      "text": "management of LTBI should primarily take into account the evidence in providing a lasting prevention from",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        697.2659301757812,
        526.6312866210938,
        710.06591796875
      ],
      "text": "progression to active TB (e.g. absence of continuous transmission and reinfection) with benefits outweighing",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.2659301757812,
        526.619140625,
        724.06591796875
      ],
      "text": "risks to the individuals belong to the group and the efficient use of resources. The GDG noted that prioritization",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        725.2659301757812,
        526.6301879882812,
        738.06591796875
      ],
      "text": "of at-risk groups for LTBI testing and treatment could yield savings for the health care system. The GDG noted",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        739.2659301757812,
        526.6131591796875,
        752.06591796875
      ],
      "text": "the value of ART for preventing TB in people living with HIV, underlining the importance of ensuring provision",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.2659301757812,
        371.7261047363281,
        766.06591796875
      ],
      "text": "of ART for all people living with HIV as per the current WHO policy  . (29)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
        790.2608032226562,
        552.3746948242188,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "13",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        171.12399291992188,
        796.524658203125,
        524.4039916992188,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "2. IDENTIFICATION OF POPULATIONS FOR TESTING AND TREATMENT OF LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}